<< /A 369 0 R /Alt (Infographic depicts types of adoptive cell therapy \(ACT\) products, key antitumor mechanisms, metabolic pathways, and ovarian cancer tumor microenvironment \(TME\) barriers. Categories of ACT cells, pathways of activation, cytotoxic execution, metabolic and immune evasion, immunosuppressive cells, and TME-induced T cell exhaustion are shown with text and icon-style illustrations, highlighting therapy combinations and molecular mechanisms affecting ovarian cancer treatment outcomes.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 19 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
